1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:01,732
Kapal ini tenggelam...

2
00:00:01,732 --> 00:00:03,947
di zaman Piramida Giza dibangun.

3
00:00:03,947 --> 00:00:06,850
Umurnya hingga 4.700 tahun,

4
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:09,528
diklaim kapal karam tertua di dunia.

5
00:00:09,528 --> 00:00:11,614
Ditemukan di dasar laut Turki.

6
00:00:11,614 --> 00:00:12,835
Masalahnya,

7
00:00:12,835 --> 00:00:14,803
kayu kapalnya sudah lenyap.

8
00:00:14,803 --> 00:00:17,244
Umurnya tak bisa diuji karbon.

9
00:00:17,244 --> 00:00:18,110
Jadi,

10
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:19,931
arkeolog membaca gucinya.

11
00:00:19,931 --> 00:00:24,213
Bentuknya cocok dengan guci Zaman
Perunggu dari Mesir dan Timur Tengah.

12
00:00:24,213 --> 00:00:25,827
Dan beberapa guci...

13
00:00:25,827 --> 00:00:27,717
masih menyimpan sisa isinya.

14
00:00:27,717 --> 00:00:28,609
Menurutmu,

15
00:00:28,609 --> 00:00:29,949
isinya apa?
